{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3Wedderburn","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3Wedderburn","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3Characters","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3BlockRep"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.wedderburn₃","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.wedderburn₃","kind":"def","line":237,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L237-L266","doc":"**The rank-3 Wedderburn isomorphism (sorry-free):**\n$H_3(q) \\cong K \\times K \\times M_2(K)$ whenever $q \\neq 0$,\n$q^2+1 \\neq 0$ and $q^4+q^2+1 \\neq 0$ — exactly the Wenzl\ngenericity locus at rank 3, read off the determinant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_wedderburnInvV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_wedderburnInvV","kind":"theorem","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L206-L235","doc":"**Right inverse, matrix block (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_wedderburnInvV_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_wedderburnInvV_minus","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L195-L204","doc":"**Right inverse, second character (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_wedderburnInvV_plus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_wedderburnInvV_plus","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L184-L193","doc":"**Right inverse, first character (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.wedderburnInvV_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.wedderburnInvV_left","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L161-L182","doc":"**Left inverse on coordinates (sorry-free):** the inverse formulas\nrecover every NF coordinate from the character/block triple. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_apply₁₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_apply₁₁","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L152-L159","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_apply₁₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_apply₁₀","kind":"theorem","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L143-L150","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_apply₀₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_apply₀₁","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L137-L141","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_apply₀₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_apply₀₀","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L127-L135","doc":"Explicit entry formulas for the block map (sorry-free; proved once\nso the inverse lemmas below stay purely scalar). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.wedderburnInvV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.wedderburnInvV","kind":"def","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L110-L125","doc":"The inverse coordinate map, computed symbolically over\n$\\mathbb{Q}(q)$ and verified by the inverse lemmas below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.wedderburnHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.wedderburnHom","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L54-L108","doc":"**The assembled Wedderburn homomorphism**\n$(\\chi_+, \\chi_-, \\rho) : H_3(q) \\to K \\times K \\times M_2(K)$\n(sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.root_negInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.root_negInv","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L48-L52","doc":"`-q⁻¹` is the other root (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.root_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.root_q","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Wedderburn.lean#L43-L46","doc":"`q` is a root of the Hecke quadratic at `h = q - q⁻¹` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0}]}